sequenceDiagram
    participant browser
    participant server
    browser ->>server: POST https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/new_note
    
    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/notes
    server-->>browser: sends the code for the notes box and the submit
    
    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/main.css
    server-->>browser: sends the css file

    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/main.js
    server-->>browser: sends the main.js code

    
    browser->>server: https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/data.json
    server-->>browser: sends all the notes, including the one just added by the user.

